<description><![CDATA[<video controls><source src="" poster="https://www.instagram.com/p/DgG4clCIo6b/media?size=l" type="video/mp4"><img src="https://www.instagram.com/p/DgG4clCIo6b/media?size=l" alt=""></video><br><br>&ldquo;We have upgraded Indian equities from neutral to overweight position.&rdquo;<br />
<br />
Samir Subberwal , global head of wealth solutions at Standard Chartered bank @stanchartin tells me why they&rsquo;ve upgraded Indian equities. <br />
<br />
The AI trade isn&rsquo;t over, but it&rsquo;s mid-cycle, so returns will be more muted. And as that money moves out of AI, it&rsquo;ll find its way into India. You&rsquo;ve already seen it in the last one month.<br />
