62761578568426023_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ig_cache_key=NDAzNTk2NzExMzI0Nzg5Mjg1OA%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNBUk9VU0VMX0lURU0ueHBpZHMuODA3LnNkci5yZWd1bGFyX3Bob3RvLkMzIn0%3D&_nc_ohc=Avz2YxEBrkwQ7kNvwGExrEl&_nc_oc=AdozaMt5XDlCMeVnwgfrBZjBf52uCuQSvN0AKzxGr5F1lEM2KQet483d0R-I1GxD24o&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=AmvvESm3__fhGRTiCOontw&_nc_ss=7e789&_nc_ct=RQosPBUIFQIlBAAAAA&oh=00_AQUafibgeeUxBUNAIxBsM-BkL7VuEivXAfK3JKpYcmUUXQ&oe=6B10C4E7" target="_blank"><img src="https://scontent-iad6-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/917583230_18456657145134680_5462761578568426023_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ig_cache_key=NDAzNTk2NzExMzI0Nzg5Mjg1OA%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNBUk9VU0VMX0lURU0ueHBpZHMuODA3LnNkci5yZWd1bGFyX3Bob3RvLkMzIn0%3D&_nc_ohc=Avz2YxEBrkwQ7kNvwGExrEl&_nc_oc=AdozaMt5XDlCMeVnwgfrBZjBf52uCuQSvN0AKzxGr5F1lEM2KQet483d0R-I1GxD24o&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=AmvvESm3__fhGRTiCOontw&_nc_ss=7e789&_nc_ct=RQosPBUIFQIlBAAAAA&oh=00_AQUafibgeeUxBUNAIxBsM-BkL7VuEivXAfK3JKpYcmUUXQ&oe=6B10C4E7" alt="One of my favourite places we visited this year was the beautiful Kanha National Park, one of India’s earliest tiger..." /></a><br><br>One of my favourite places we visited this year was the beautiful Kanha National Park, one of India&rsquo;s earliest tiger reserves when project tiger was launched in 1973 and a place that brought back the almost extinct Barasingha deer. <br />
<br />
A 2000 square km forest reserve with the most gorgeous endless land of Sal trees. It is one of the most bio diverse forests of India with over 300 species of birds and 500 species of insects. A reminder of just how beautiful India is. <br />
<br />
Everything about this place is magical ✨ <br />
<br />
Big shoutout to the wonderful team at @rootsnatureclub ❤️ for organising the dreamiest forest school in the middle of this magical land. <br />
